WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.270 --> 00:00:03.300
It starts with a call, a message or a website.

2
00:00:03.610 --> 00:00:05.720
Police. CBI. Your bank.

3
00:00:06.380 --> 00:00:08.150
They work on fear and stress:

4
00:00:08.570 --> 00:00:11.360
an arrest, a blocked account, a son in trouble.

5
00:00:12.480 --> 00:00:15.560
The people losing the most are digitally vulnerable elders.

6
00:00:16.060 --> 00:00:20.880
They pay on their own phones, answer every call, and are often alone when it rings.

7
00:00:21.450 --> 00:00:25.370
In 2025, senior citizens reported over a lakh financial frauds:

8
00:00:25.720 --> 00:00:29.360
four thousand crore rupees, nearly five times more per case.

9
00:00:30.230 --> 00:00:32.040
In fifty real cases,

10
00:00:32.570 --> 00:00:36.370
digital arrests did the most damage, then fake trading apps.

11
00:00:36.880 --> 00:00:38.890
A warning alone was not enough.

12
00:00:39.210 --> 00:00:42.380
Every scam stopped in time was stopped by another person.

13
00:00:43.300 --> 00:00:44.730
So we built Ruko.

14
00:00:45.800 --> 00:00:47.820
It never listens to your calls.

15
00:00:49.260 --> 00:00:51.970
It waits for the risky moment in a call with a stranger:

16
00:00:52.320 --> 00:00:55.690
a bank app opens, an OTP arrives, or a screen-sharing app starts.

17
00:00:56.310 --> 00:00:58.100
Ruko steps in at once:

18
00:00:58.450 --> 00:00:59.950
“Pause. This looks like a scam.”

19
00:01:00.100 --> 00:01:01.040
And it says it aloud.

20
00:01:02.320 --> 00:01:04.760
If you choose, Ruko also brings in someone you trust.

21
00:01:05.400 --> 00:01:07.180
Their phone rings at the same moment,

22
00:01:07.710 --> 00:01:08.750
so they can call you back.

23
00:01:10.220 --> 00:01:11.300
It checks messages too:

24
00:01:12.050 --> 00:01:15.170
fake links, app files, and senders pretending to be your bank.

25
00:01:16.050 --> 00:01:17.600
Urgent scams show red.

26
00:01:17.850 --> 00:01:19.320
The rest, a calm “you’re safe”.

27
00:01:20.520 --> 00:01:24.550
In English, Hindi, Tamil, Telugu, Malayalam and Kannada.

28
00:01:25.370 --> 00:01:26.550
And nothing leaves your phone.

29
00:01:28.300 --> 00:01:28.610
Ruko.

30
00:01:30.040 --> 00:01:32.310
Another person, at the right moment.

31
00:01:32.940 --> 00:01:34.800
Built for family safety.

